  "approval": {
    "approvedBy": "Charlie Cheever",
    "approvedAt": "2026-08-13",
    "rationale": "First-release ceilings accepted to unblock LLP 0047 section 9 measurement. Size maxima implement LLP 0029's documented hypothesis that a hello executable stays under deno compile's ~65 MB, with headroom on the large-graph and diagnostic factory-table lanes. Startup maxima are first-release regression gates under the named uncontrolled OS-cache protocol, not competitive claims. Dynamic-dependency maxima are closed system-library counts: Apple system libraries on macOS, and the Linux DT_NEEDED allowlist plus the vdso/loader lines ldd may report. factoryTableDisposition stays undecided-pending-measurement so this acceptance does not promote that carrier."
  },
